        "| **IT** | hostname, GB used, GB total | `srv-01`, `87`, `120` |\n",
        "\n",
        "## What to build\n",
        "\n",
        "**Threshold — pass standard.** Ask for the three values, print them back in a bordered report.\n",
        "\n",
        "```\n",
        "==================================\n",
